This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Shard d of check-24-adversarial-convergence runs units k3 and k3c: the located validator in place over K3 worlds the fixture builds itself. The validator resolves its root from the --series path and its siblings from its own path, and the remediation-guard hook it records with is copied verbatim by install.sh and run in place by its own shipped fixtures. A consumer runs the shipped shards a-c, which keep the validator lookup in either layout, the in-place series cases and the installed acknowledge hook and remediator role.
